 Claude Code accounts

 Devpit will forget the Claude Code account work.

 These folders used it and will use instead:
   C:\Projects   default (you@personal.example), like everywhere else

 ! Its folder stays where it is, with its sign-in: C:\Users\you\.devpit\accounts\claude\work.
   Delete it yourself once you are sure you no longer need it.

 Devpit will write:
   ~/AppData/Roaming/devpit/accounts.toml (changes)
     [[account]] claude work

╭─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Remove work from Devpit?                                │
│ You can undo it afterwards with u on the Accounts page. │
│                                                         │
│ Type REMOVE to continue:                                │
│                                                         │
│ [ No ]   [ Yes ]                                        │
╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯



[keys] y/n yes/no  ·  enter confirm
